{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜神廿四即將升空(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-24-13-57-51ZtiYGiui.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：神廿四即將升空</p><p>神舟二十四號載人飛行任務即將於周三升空，中國太空站首次迎來外籍航天員，現時準備工作進入最後倒數階段，今次升空有甚麼看點？</p><p>嘉賓：香港航天學會會長雷健泉</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.104563+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:31.377379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:42.128719+00:00","content_hash":"aaad07918c026abb14dc3c7f71f4f16bcb3aa71b7af925dd25ed9c7d4f5b5af6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}